  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we understand the passion for soccer, and this comforter set is designed to ignite that enthusiasm in young fans. Inspired by their favorite soccer stars, this bedding set encourages children to embrace their soccer dreams, making it a perfect addition to any soccer-themed room.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Soccer Enthusiasm Theme:</strong> Designed for young soccer enthusiasts, inspiring dreams and excitement for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Features a hidden zipper and smooth metal pull for convenient duvet insertion and removal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Utilizes environmental protection techniques for colorfastness, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Machine Washable:</strong> Simple care; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for optimal fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalization Options:</strong> May include text input for custom name and number.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Soccer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Full</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
